# Zapier Email Automation (Form to Auto Reply)

## 🎥 Demo
[https://youtu.be/sQUI4FBLWiU]

## ❓ Problem
Manual responses to form submissions take time.

## 💡 Solution
Used Zapier to automate email replies when a form is submitted.

## ⚙️ Workflow
1. Form submission (trigger)
2. Zapier automation
3. Send email response

## 🛠️ Tools Used
- Zapier

## ⚖️ Comparison
Zapier vs Make.com:
- Zapier: beginner-friendly
- Make.com: more flexible

## 🚀 Key Learning
Choosing the right tool is as important as building the workflow.
